SUMMARY:Embedded Accessible Educational Services (AES)
DESCRIPTION:At the LGBTQ+ Culture Center\, we want every student to have 
 the resources they need to thrive. Disabilities come in all shapes and si
 zes\, and many are not visible to others. Accessible Educational Services
  (AES) partners with students to provide accommodations\, support service
 s\, and tools that help create equal access and opportunity at IU.  Kade 
 Padgett\, M.A.\, an AES Access Coordinator\, is available at the LGBTQ+ C
 ulture Center every Friday from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. during drop-in adv
 ising hours. Whether you're curious about accommodations\, have questions
  about the process\, or simply want to learn more about available resourc
 es\, we invite you to stop by and chat with Kade about the support option
 s that may be available to you.  All Indiana University events\, groups\,
  activities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome
  all members of the Indiana University community.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div><p>    At the LGBTQ+ Culture Center\, w
 e want every student to have the resources they need to thrive. Disabilit
 ies come in all shapes and sizes\, and many are not visible to others. Ac
 cessible Educational Services (AES) partners with students to provide acc
 ommodations\, support services\, and tools that help create equal access 
 and opportunity at IU.  </p><p><strong>Kade Padgett\, M.A.\, an AES Acces
 s Coordinator\,</strong> is available at the LGBTQ+ Culture Center every 
 Friday from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. during drop-in advising hours. Whether
  you're curious about accommodations\, have questions about the process\,
  or simply want to learn more about available resources\, we invite you t
 o stop by and chat with Kade about the support options that may be availa
 ble to you.  </p><p><strong>All Indiana University events\, groups\, acti
 vities\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all 
 members of the Indiana University community.</strong></p></div>
