DTSTART:20261001T210000Z
DTEND:20261001T223000Z
LOCATION:LGBTQ+ CULTURE CENTER
GEO:39.168722;-86.525274
SUMMARY:The Importance of Voting for the LGBTQ+ Community
DESCRIPTION:Make Your Voice Heard!                                  Join 
 us for an evening of conversation\, learning\, and community as we explor
 e the power of voting and civic engagement in shaping a more inclusive fu
 ture for LGBTQ+ communities. Our guest speaker (TBD) will share insights 
 on the history of voting rights\, the impact of collective action\, and w
 hy participation in the 2026 election matters. Whether you're a first-tim
 e voter or a longtime advocate\, you'll have the opportunity to ask quest
 ions\, share perspectives\, and connect with others who are passionate ab
 out making a difference.                                Ready to take act
 ion? Register to vote! Visit www.indianavoters.in.gov to check your regis
 tration status or register to vote (you can also click on the "register" 
 button below). Follow the LGBTQ+ Culture Center on QNews\, Facebook\, and
  Instagram for voter registration updates\, election information\, and im
 portant deadlines. The deadline to register to vote in Indiana is October
  5\, 2026.                                  Come learn\, connect\, and ta
 ke the next step toward making your voice count.                         
        All Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\
 , cultural\, and historical observances welcome all members of the Indian
 a University community.                                  &#160\;
